# Users of valkey-queue (specs/07 §5.3, NFR-SEC-03): each component reaches only its own keys and no
# administrative command. @API_PASSWORD@ and @WORKER_PASSWORD@ come from the environment
# (start-queue.sh); a phase that adds keys adds them here. Dramatiq names its namespace `dramatiq`
# as a key of its scripts, then `dramatiq:<queue>...`.
#
# default: the container health check only.
user default on nopass -@all +ping
# api: puts checks on the Dramatiq queues, keeps the queue positions.
user api on >@API_PASSWORD@ ~dramatiq ~dramatiq:* ~queue:* +@all -@dangerous
# worker: takes checks from the queues, removes their positions, holds leases and counts attempts.
user worker on >@WORKER_PASSWORD@ ~dramatiq ~dramatiq:* %W~queue:* ~lease:* ~attempts:* +@all -@dangerous
